  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Total cases&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></math><br />For favorable cases,<br />let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfrac></math> (must be an integer)<br />if <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4,5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6,7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8,9</mn></math><br />if <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4,6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />if <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6,9</mn></math><br />if <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />for <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5,6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7,8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> no such value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></math> is possible<br />Hence, the required probability <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
